## elaborations.soar -- selection-world: 3 elaborations.

## Elaborate failure-evaluation substate selection-superstate -> sets selection-s.
sp {selection-world*elaborate*failure-evaluation*substate*selection-superstate
   :default
   (state <s> ^name failure-evaluation
              ^superstate.selection-superstate <ss>)
-->
   (<s> ^selection-superstate <ss>)
}

## Elaborate failure-evaluation substate world.
sp {selection-world*elaborate*failure-evaluation*substate*world
   :default
   (state <s> ^name failure-evaluation
              ^superstate.world <w>)
-->
   (<s> ^world <w>)
}

## Elaborate failure-evaluation substate world2.
sp {selection-world*elaborate*failure-evaluation*substate*world2
   :default
   (state <s> ^name failure-evaluation
              ^superstate.superstate.world <w>)
-->
   (<s> ^world <w>)
}
